# What must not reach the build context.
#
# The first two entries are the ones that matter: `.env` files hold real
# credentials for the quarantine bucket and the database, and a build
# context is not a secret store. Everything else is here to keep the image
# small and the layer cache useful.
.env
.env.*
config/environments/.env*
!config/environments/.env.example

node_modules
dist
coverage
reports
.stryker-tmp

.git
.github
.husky
.vscode
docs
scripts
test

*.md
!README.md
